---
Name: Create Card
Description: Create a new card in a project column. Can create either a note card or add an issue/PR to the column.
Credential: ./credential
Param: columnId: the ID of the column to add the card to
Param: note: (optional) text content for a note card
Param: contentId: (optional) ID of the issue or PR to add
Param: contentType: (optional) type of content ('Issue' or 'PullRequest')

#!/usr/bin/env node ${GPTSCRIPT_TOOL_DIR}/index.js createCard

---
Name: Move Card
Description: Move a card to a different column and position
Credential: ./credential
Param: cardId: the ID of the card to move
Param: columnId: the ID of the column to move the card to
Param: position: (optional) position in the column ('top', 'bottom', or 'after:<card-id>')

#!/usr/bin/env node ${GPTSCRIPT_TOOL_DIR}/index.js moveCard

---
Name: Update Card
Description: Update a card's note content
Credential: ./credential
Param: cardId: the ID of the card to update
Param: note: the new note content

#!/usr/bin/env node ${GPTSCRIPT_TOOL_DIR}/index.js updateCard

---
Name: Delete Card
Description: Delete a card from a project
Credential: ./credential
Param: cardId: the ID of the card to delete

#!/usr/bin/env node ${GPTSCRIPT_TOOL_DIR}/index.js deleteCard

